{
  "body_human_readable": "\n**Chilly Conditions with Snow in Kyiv**\n\nKyiv, Ukraine is currently experiencing wintry weather with cloudy skies and periods of snow. Temperatures are hovering between 18\u00b0F and 22\u00b0F (approximately -6\u00b0C to -8\u00b0C). However, due to wind and other factors, the \"RealFeel\" temperature is considerably colder, ranging from 0\u00b0F to 9\u00b0F (-18\u00b0C to -13\u00b0C).\n\nThere is a high chance of precipitation, with snow accumulating. Some areas could see light to moderate snowfall.\n\nWinds are blowing from the southeast at speeds of 7 to 14 mph, with gusts reaching up to 27 mph, adding to the cold feel. The cloud cover is extensive, at 100%. Looking ahead, the forecast suggests continued cold and snowy conditions.",
